  "folder": "ggcgFnF1mKuFDAQc",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The soles of these boots have never worn thin. Dust from every road they have walked lies in the seams, in colors that no single country has, and it cannot be brushed out.</p><p>While you wear these boots, your Speed increases by 10 feet, Difficult Terrain costs you no extra movement, and a day of travel on foot never tires you.</p><p><strong>Long Step.</strong> Once per day, as a Bonus Action, you step to a place you can see within 500 feet. The boots regain this power at dawn.</p><p><strong>Every Road Remembered.</strong> The boots remember every road. The wearer can always find the way back to any place where they have slept, and by standing in another person's footprints can follow the route that person walked, however old the trail.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
